  m_Name: Cause_air_filter_failure
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Residue.Data::Residue.Data.RootCauseDef
  id: air_filter_failure
  displayName: Air Filter / Intake Seal Failure
  explanation: Silicon rising WITH aluminium and iron means abrasive dirt is entering
    through the intake. The worn component is a symptom. Replace it without fixing
    the filter and the next sample looks identical.
